• Equal participation of foreign investors in government procurements;
• No expropriation of foreign investments unless such expropriation is for public interests, pursuant to statutory procedures and fair and reasonable compensation is timely paid;
• Open inward and outward remittance of contributions, profits, capital gains, income from asset disposal, royalties of intellectual property rights, lawfully obtained compensation or
indemnity and income from the liquidation of foreign-invested enterprises within the territory of China in RMB or a foreign currency in accordance with laws;
• Protection of intellectual property rights of foreign investors and foreign-invested enterprises, encouragement of technology cooperation on the basis of transparent business rules and
prohibition of compulsory technology transfers;
• No impairment of legitimate rights and interests, or imposition of additional obligations or conditions, to market access and normal production and operating activities of foreign invested enterprises unless otherwise stipulated by laws and regulations.
